    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A merging of dissociation between dream worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in nightmares.  Find your way through the desolate worlds, happy dreams and hidden horrors.<br><br>Fend off enemy fiends in this top-Down exploration merged with 2D platforming exploration large scale adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large variety of top-down environments populated with interactable NPCs Characters and participate in various optional and necessary quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 450+ items &amp; power-ups abilities.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a large variety of platforming landscapes over hundreds of areas.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between overlapping mirror worlds in real time after collecting the mirror item. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a large variety of optional and necessary puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a multitude of optional hidden secrets, hidden side-quests and hidden collectables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ bosses<br> 50+ different enemy types<br>15+ NPC types<br>450+ collectable items and abilities to collect</p>",
